<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/mailer"><div class="form-field json-field " data-type="json" style="--grid-area: whitelist;"><label for="field-UID">Email Domain Whitelist</label><div class="form-group"><textarea id="field-UID" name="whitelist" rows="8" placeholder="[&quot;@yourcompany.com&quot;, &quot;@trustedclient.com&quot;]" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="help-UID"></textarea><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Array of allowed email domains (e.g., ["@yourcompany.com", "@trustedclient.com"]). Leave empty to disable whitelist.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: ratePerIp;"><label for="field-UID">Rate Limit per IP</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="ratePerIp" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="10" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="10" min="1" max="1000" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Maximum number of emails that can be sent from a single IP address per time window.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: ratePerTemplate;"><label for="field-UID">Rate Limit per Template</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="ratePerTemplate" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="50" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="50" min="1" max="10000" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Maximum number of emails that can be sent using a single template per time window.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: rateWindow;"><label for="field-UID">Rate Limit Window (seconds)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="rateWindow" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="300" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="300" min="60" max="3600" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Time window in seconds for rate limiting. Default is 300 seconds (5 minutes).</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>